    "part": 3,
    "title": "Protecting a smaller model",
    "titleZh": "保護小型機種",
    "topic": "manufacturing",
    "passage": "Man: Three samples were damaged in the drop test. The shipping boxes looked fine, but the units shifted inside.\nWoman: Were we using the new packing inserts?\nMan: No. The packing station still used the old inserts. They leave a gap around the smaller model.\nWoman: Do not pack that model again until the new inserts arrive. They should get here this afternoon.\nMan: Should we also change the shipping label?\nWoman: The label is correct. Take photos comparing the old and new inserts. Add the photos to the work instruction.",
    "passageZh": "男：跌落測試中有三件樣品受損。出貨紙箱外觀完好，但產品在箱內移位了。\n女：當時用的是新的包裝內襯嗎？\n男：沒有。包裝站當時仍用舊內襯，小型機種周圍會留下空隙。\n女：新內襯到貨前，不要再包裝那個機種。它們應該今天下午會到。\n男：我們也該更換出貨標籤嗎？\n女：標籤沒有問題。請拍下比較新舊內襯的照片，把照片加入作業指導書。",
    "audioScript": "Three samples were damaged in the drop test. The shipping boxes looked fine, but the units shifted inside.\nWere we using the new packing inserts?\nNo. The packing station still used the old inserts. They leave a gap around the smaller model.\nDo not pack that model again until the new inserts arrive. They should get here this afternoon.\nShould we also change the shipping label?\nThe label is correct. Take photos comparing the old and new inserts. Add the photos to the work instruction.",
    "turns": [
      {
        "voice": "male",
        "text": "Three samples were damaged in the drop test. The shipping boxes looked fine, but the units shifted inside."
      },
      {
        "voice": "female",
        "text": "Were we using the new packing inserts?"
      },
      {
        "voice": "male",
        "text": "No. The packing station still used the old inserts. They leave a gap around the smaller model."
      },
      {
        "voice": "female",
        "text": "Do not pack that model again until the new inserts arrive. They should get here this afternoon."
      },
      {
        "voice": "male",
        "text": "Should we also change the shipping label?"
      },
      {
        "voice": "female",
        "text": "The label is correct. Take photos comparing the old and new inserts. Add the photos to the work instruction."
      }
    ],
